The lessons and combat progression need to be connected.

Full curriculum:
- Exactly 30 lessons

Free version:
- 3 lessons
- 5 bosses
- Regular/minion enemies associated with the boss progression

The player should not simply study all three free lessons continuously and then suddenly fight a boss.

The intended concept is:

Learn → demonstrate/test → fight regular enemies/minions → boss → continue progression.

Use the existing curriculum and project structure. Do not invent new educational content or change the intended meaning.

